1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Freelancers lose money when fixed-scope work turns into endless extra requests.
FairFlow AI makes every agreement, scope change and Sandbox payment clear.

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Our interactive Scope Lab shows the potential impact of added features.
These illustrative estimates lead directly into the working application.

3
00:00:37,000 --> 00:01:05,000
In the real workbench, Google Gemini transforms a rough brief into a structured proposal:
deliverables, estimated pricing, assumptions, risks and milestones.

4
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:27,000
AI suggests. The freelancer reviews and explicitly approves the quote.
Planning milestones add up to one hundred percent.

5
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Scope Guard compares a new client request against the approved baseline.
It estimates additional cost and time, but never silently changes the approved quote.

6
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:25,000
PayPal Sandbox supports buyer approval and a single full-quote test payment.
Our server verifies the USD order and completed capture before saving a receipt.

7
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:40,000
The saved receipt and audit trail can be reopened without charging again.
FairFlow AI: Every Change Deserves Fair Pay.
